  "benefits": "\n  - **For Farmer Field Schools:** Financial Assistance: Grants of ₹17,000/- is allowed towards Demonstration of 40 Ha. each and Training per Farmers Field School through cluster approach.  - **For Farmers:** Training &amp;amp; Demonstration: Hands-on training in pest management through Farmer Field Schools.\n<br>\n\n",
